msgstr "什麼是 RetroDB?"

#: templates/setup.html:42
msgid ""
"RetroDB is a web-based retro gaming ROM library manager. It helps you "
"organize your ROM collection, scrape metadata from multiple sources, "
"track achievements, and more."
msgstr "RetroDB 是網頁版的復古遊戲 ROM 遊戲庫管理工具。它能幫您整理 ROM 收藏、從多個來源抓取中繼資料、追蹤成就等等。"

#: templates/setup.html:44
msgid "Organize ROMs across 270+ gaming platforms"
msgstr "整理 270 多個遊戲平台的 ROM"

#: templates/setup.html:45
msgid "Scrape metadata from TheGamesDB, IGDB, RAWG, ScreenScraper"
msgstr "從 TheGamesDB、IGDB、RAWG、ScreenScraper 抓取中繼資料"

#: templates/setup.html:46
msgid "Track RetroAchievements progress and PS3 trophies"
msgstr "追蹤 RetroAchievements 進度與 PS3 獎盃"

#: templates/setup.html:47
msgid "ROM tools: archive scanner, CHD converter, duplicate finder"
msgstr "ROM 工具：壓縮檔掃描器、CHD 轉換器、重複檔案搜尋"

#: templates/setup.html:48
msgid "Analytics dashboard with collection statistics"
msgstr "含收藏統計的分析儀表板"

#: templates/setup.html:79
msgid "Disclaimers"
msgstr "免責聲明"

#: templates/setup.html:81
msgid "ROM Legality:"
msgstr "ROM 合法性："

#: templates/setup.html:81
msgid ""
"RetroDB is a library manager and does not provide, host, or distribute "
"ROM files. You are solely responsible for ensuring your ROM collection "
"complies with the laws of your jurisdiction."
msgstr "RetroDB 是遊戲庫管理工具，不提供、代管或散布 ROM 檔案。您須自行確保您的 ROM 收藏符合所在地區的法律。"

#: templates/setup.html:82
msgid "Third-Party APIs:"
msgstr "第三方 API："

#: templates/setup.html:82
msgid ""
"Metadata scraping uses external services (IGDB, ScreenScraper, RAWG, "
"TheGamesDB, RetroAchievements) that are subject to their own terms of "
"service and rate limits."
msgstr "中繼資料抓取會使用外部服務（IGDB、ScreenScraper、RAWG、TheGamesDB、RetroAchievements），這些服務各有其服務條款與請求頻率限制。"

#: templates/setup.html:83
